LavenderTown_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "That’s quite some building, eh?\p"
	.string "It’s KANTO’s RADIO TOWER.$"

LavenderTown_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "People come from all over to pay\n"
	.string "their respects to the departed souls\l"
	.string "of POKéMON.$"

LavenderTown_Text_Boy::
	.string "You need a POKéFLUTE to wake\n"
	.string "sleeping POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Every trainer has to know that!$"

LavenderTown_Text_Woman2::
	.string "KANTO has many good radio shows.$"

LavenderTown_Text_CrushGirl::
	.string "Hi, what’s up?$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6_1::
	.string "AMELIA: ...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "I have been practicing a lot after\n"
	.string "our last battle.\p"
	.string "You have been an inspiration for me.\n"
	.string "That’s why I kept training even when\l"
	.string "things didn’t look good...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}...\n"
	.string "...Blush...$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6_2::
	.string "AMELIA: But I need to do this...\p"
	.string "I need to show you the results\n"
	.string "of all my hard work!$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6_3::
	.string "AMELIA: Let’s battle, here and now!$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6Defeat::
	.string "{PLAYER}, you are so strong...\p"
	.string "But I’ll keep training, because this\n"
	.string "defeat shows me I can still be\l"
	.string "stronger.$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6Victory::
	.string "I’m so happy...\n"
	.string "I defeated {PLAYER}!$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6_4::
	.string "AMELIA: All right. I may not be\n"
	.string "strong enough to defeat you...\l"
	.string "yet...\p"
	.string "Do you think you’ll battle me some\n"
	.string "other time?$"

LavenderTown_Text_Trigger6_5::
	.string "AMELIA: ...Thanks...\n"
	.string "For being such a good friend.\p"
	.string "I’m going...\n"
	.string "Good luck!$"

LavenderTown_Text_Sign1::
	.string "LAVENDER TOWN\n"
	.string "The Noble Purple Town$"

LavenderTown_Text_Sign2::
	.string "SOUL HOUSE\n"
	.string "May the Souls of POKéMON Rest Easy$"

LavenderTown_Text_Sign3::
	.string "KANTO RADIO STATION\p"
	.string "Your Favorite Programs On-Air Around\n"
	.string "the Clock!$"

LavenderTown_Text_Sign4::
	.string "LAVENDER VOLUNTEER POKéMON HOUSE$"
